'''Snowman''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. Its handle is a grey gradient with three snowmen wearing red hats on it, as well as white circular snowflakes. The guard is white and the handle is black. 

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Snowman Gun (2022)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

